## What to deliver

Build the tileset up operation by operation until each `frames/<index>.png`
matches the brief: a consistent 16-piece autotile of rounded, raised soil-tunnel
walls (frames 0–15, the index being the connection bitmask) whose connected edges
line up seamlessly, plus the three-piece central boundary seam (16–18) and the
seamless dug floor (19), all in the shared earth palette. Settle one wall
cross-section and reuse its exact thickness and rim in every tile so they tile
without seams. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs
are your finished submission.
